{
  "title": "Label icon-only meal-plan card edit/remove buttons on iOS",
  "description": "MealPlanItemCard.swift renders the edit (pencil.circle) and remove (xmark.circle.fill) actions as Image-only Buttons with no accessibilityLabel, so VoiceOver announces SF Symbol names instead of what the button does or which meal it affects. \
Add labels like \"Edit <recipe title>\" / \"Remove <recipe title>\" and cover them in RamekinUITests. \
Web's MealPlanPage.tsx edit/remove buttons only have title=\"Edit\"/\"Remove\"; consider including the recipe title there too so repeated buttons are distinguishable.",
